abstract: >-
  TendrilGrow is a Home Assistant custom integration (HACS) for indoor
  cultivation: per-grow-space configuration, sensor and control role mapping,
  optional Tuya cloud water monitoring, camera-based AI health checks, and
  pluggable AI provider model discovery.
